# Working notes and review documents; not needed to run the pipeline
_internal_notes/
# Files retired from the pipeline, kept for the record
_retired_*/
# Byte-identical copies of the source files as they stood before an edit
_backup_*/
# Knitted HTML renderings of the R Markdown files; regenerated on every knit
*.html
# Figure files that knitr writes beside an HTML rendering
*_files/
# knitr chunk caches; regenerated on the next knit
*_cache/
# Stray plot file that R writes when a plot is drawn outside a chunk
Rplots.pdf
# macOS Finder metadata
.DS_Store
# the language-model response cache from the retired pipeline (folder name starts with a dot, so *_cache/ does not match it)
nlp/.cache/
# Google Drive pointer files and anything named as a key file must never be published
*.gdoc
*API Keys*
# The two published word-norm files are not ours to redistribute; nlp/norms/README.md says where to download them
nlp/norms/*.txt
nlp/norms/*.csv
